Subject: sunxi: H713: sequence the V2 lamp at boot logo commit

Show the native V2 logo from PREBOOT on normal boots. Use the compiled
PREBOOT policy even with an existing RAUC environment. The fastboot and
bootloader reboot modes take their existing branches.

Keep the V2 shared lamp and fan enable low until the logo frame has
committed and PWM2 is running at the vendor DTB's 75% default. Disable the
lamp before tearing down scanout and the panel supply.
--- a/arch/arm/mach-sunxi/h713_mips.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-sunxi/h713_mips.c
@@ -210,7 +210,7 @@
 static bool h713_disp_single_launch_logo;
 
 static int h713_disp_publish_vendor_bootlogo(bool load, bool chroma);
-static void h713_disp_commit_osd_frame(void);
+static bool h713_disp_commit_osd_frame(void);
